  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "唐人小說與社會",
    "sub_ename": "NOVELS OF THE TANG DYNASTY AND SOCIETY",
    "describe_ch": "唐朝前期社會文化繁榮，是中國歷史上的鼎盛時期，中後期因「安史之亂」而衰弱，士人寫出精采的小說，反映社會價值和生活態度。本課程旨在透過研讀唐代經典小說，讓學生反思唐代與當代社會價值觀。透過深入解析文本，學生將探討唐代社會背景及人生觀，並將之與現實社會連結，引導學生思考小說中的價值觀在現代的意義，表達對當代社會價值的見解，使其體會古典文學對現實生活的啟示。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to allow students to reflect on the values of the Tang Dynasty and contemporary society through studying classic novels of the Tang Dynasty. Through in-depth analysis of the text, students explore the social background and outlook on life in the Tang Dynasty and connect them with real society, guiding students to think about the modern significance of the values in the novel and express their own opinions. Explore the values of contemporary society and let them experience the enlightenment of classical literature on real life.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
